      "program_name": "English",
      "university": "North Carolina State University",
      "comments": "So excited and very thankful! This is my first acceptance of the season, and I was absolutely terrified I would not get in anywhere, especially because I started receiving lots of rejections. In case anyone wants to know more details as I know NCSU tends to release decisions rolling according to past years: I applied for the funded MA here for the Rhetoric/Composition track, and I was not alerted my decision came out on my applicant portal. I just happened to realize by logging in and checking today. I was very surprised to see that a decision had been made. There is no details on funding or if I got the assistantship yet, not sure if they are deciding that later or if they already decided the recipients. Hope this is helpful and good luck to everyone waiting on a decision! 1 Admit/1 Waitlist/8 Rejections/8 Pending",
